1
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:22,800
How many more days do you think
his life can burn for this world?

2
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,260
But that friend of yours is really smart.

3
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,200
He knew he couldn't escape,

4
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,560
so he wanted to use his last breath

5
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:49,530
to protect you and everyone else
so you could get out.

6
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:52,840
Inside this is the system backdoor key
he forcibly extracted

7
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:55,000
using administrator privileges.

8
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,930
He asked me to pass it to you.

9
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:59,400
He wants you to destroy this fake world

10
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,120
and bring everyone back to reality.

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:01,980
What about him?

12
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:02,800
If the system shatters,

13
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:03,600
how will he get out?

14
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,720
Get out?
From the moment he got this USB drive,

15
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:09,120
he never planned
to leave himself a way out.

16
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:09,960
No,

17
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,200
I will absolutely not
leave him behind alone.

18
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,330
I'm going to take him out alive with me.

19
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:16,960
You two are exactly the same,

20
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:20,170
both valuing the other's life
more than your own.

21
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,000
Listen,

22
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:23,360
the Shepherd is not invincible.

23
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,970
His algorithm is absolutely rational

24
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:28,620
and can automatically repair
anger or fear.

25
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:31,120
But there is one thing
he cannot calculate:

26
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,690
the emotional paradox.

27
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,850
Emotional paradox?

28
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,330
What does that mean?

29
00:01:35,479 --> 00:01:36,880
Machines can never calculate

30
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:39,280
the contradiction of true human emotions.

31
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,680
When someone is in soul-tearing pain

32
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,640
but can still smile gently.

33
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,600
This kind of relief in pain

34
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:49,200
is a virus
that can crash the system instantly.

35
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:50,800
But this kind of data,

36
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:51,600
ordinary people

37
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:52,600
cannot generate.

38
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,460
Only the current Liu Yiyang
can generate it.

39
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,720
Xiao Han,

40
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,800
you must make him smile
at his most painful moment.

41
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,800
smile.

42
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,600
The core server

43
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:07,460
is underground in that building
in the city center.

44
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:10,199
Only the current administrator can enter.

45
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,260
Southwest.

46
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:30,079
You must make him smile
at his most painful moment.

47
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,079
smile.

48
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,579
I'm sorry, Liu Yiyang.

49
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,200
For you to live,

50
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:35,960
I have to be the bad guy.

51
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:40,720
Han,

52
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:42,560
how exactly do we create this emotional
paradox Shen Lan mentioned?

53
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,640
create?

54
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:44,560
Can't we just tell Yang directly

55
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,800
and ask him to cooperate and smile?

56
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,520
No,

57
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:48,600
the Shepherd is monitoring
Liu Yiyang's data at all times.

58
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,079
If there is even a hint of acting,

59
00:02:50,079 --> 00:02:51,320
the system will recognize it immediately.

60
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,680
That way,
not only will we fail to save him,

61
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,010
but we'll also doom him.

62
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:57,200
Then what should we do?

63
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,560
Only real pain can fool the system.

64
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,000
At the most critical moment,

65
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,200
I will tell him myself

66
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,760
that I've been using him from the start,

67
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:05,920
and now he's useless.

68
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,800
Are you crazy?
Yang is almost dying to protect us.

69
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,920
dying.

70
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,400
If you stab him in the heart now,

71
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,600
he won't be able to hold on.

72
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,600
If I don't stab him,

73
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,560
he'll die.

74
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,240
Only by making him think I betrayed him,

75
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,680
plunging him into
the deepest abyss of pain,

76
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,480
will his smile

77
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,680
destroy this system.

78
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,860
But what about you?

79
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,480
Are you really going to destroy

80
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:23,600
all the trust between you two
with your own hands

81
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,720
and make him hate you forever?

82
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,320
As long as I can get him out alive,

83
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,780
he can hate me all he wants.

84
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,000
Once the gate opens,

85
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,280
if he wants to kill me,

86
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,680
I'll pay him with my life.

87
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,200
Dr. Xiao,

88
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:41,000
how come you have time for a stroll today?

89
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,000
I felt suffocated,
so I came out for some fresh air.

90
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,400
Qiqi isn't feeling well.

91
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:47,200
I'm afraid we can't go to the park
outside the city.

92
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,000
Is that so?

93
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,480
What a pity.

94
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,200
Alert: Target

95
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,079
Xiao Han has made contact
with Xiaopang and Qiqi.

96
00:03:53,079 --> 00:03:54,480
Abnormal emotional fluctuation detected.

97
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:55,200
Administrator,

98
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,000
please handle it immediately.

99
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,200
It's a shame to waste such good weather.

100
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,600
Xiao Han,

101
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,000
you know everything.

102
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,800
Do I?

103
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,800
I do.

104
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,520
You're turning to ash faster and faster.

105
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:10,800
It means this instance
is about to collapse.

106
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:13,560
We must go to the core building
before the world resets.

107
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,480
You really

108
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,279
have no sympathy at all.

109
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,240
I'm almost turning into a monster,

110
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,899
and you won't even comfort me.

111
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,360
Shen Lan gave this to me.

112
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:24,330
But he said only you have access
to the core building.

113
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:26,000
Take me in tonight.

114
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,000
Shen Lan is quite efficient.

115
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,160
Good job.

116
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,680
Once the access is unlocked tonight,

117
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,560
you'll have served your final purpose.

118
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,890
Meet me at the gate tonight.
Don't be late.

119
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:03,880
Warning: Multiple unauthorized
lifeforms detected

120
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,080
entering the core area.

121
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:07,610
Initiating physical elimination protocol.

122
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,880
Han, Yang can't hold on much longer!

123
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,360
Hurry and use Shen Lan's USB drive

124
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,760
to stop the system!

125
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:23,360
No, the USB drive can only be used
on the core server.

126
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,080
If we use it now,

127
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:25,200
all our efforts will be in vain.

128
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:28,080
Liu Yiyang, keep pushing forward!
Don't stop!

129
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,760
Get into the secret room.

130
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,159
You guys wait for us outside.

131
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:53,440
...

132
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:54,680
...

133
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,000
...

134
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:55,320
...

135
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:55,680
...

136
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,800
Detachment protocol initiated.

137
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,600
Forcing reset of administrator data.

138
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,370
Hurry and plug in the USB drive!

139
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:18,760
Xiao Han, plug in the USB drive!

140
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:21,040
Destroy it! As long as the system
is destroyed,

141
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,000
you can...

142
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:27,040
Stop moving yourself to tears.

143
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:29,100
Do you think you're saving everyone?

144
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,440
Xiao Han, what are you talking about?

145
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,960
I've known all along that

146
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:35,800
the only core access to this system
is on you.

147
00:06:36,159 --> 00:06:38,240
If I didn't play the part of your
life-and-death comrade all the way,

148
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:41,640
how could you willingly risk your life
to open the door for me?

149
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:44,600
Now the act is over,

150
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,400
and your value has come to an end.

151
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:47,200
An act?

152
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:52,159
So everything along the way
was just an act?

153
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,400
Yes.

154
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:58,880
I thought at least the bond between us
was real.

155
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:01,600
At least I could get a thank you from you.

156
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:03,090
That's not friendship.

157
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,080
That's self-satisfaction.

158
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,160
From the very beginning,

159
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,520
my only goal was

160
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:09,000
to get out alive.

161
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,260
As for whether you live or die,

162
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,200
it has nothing to do with me.

163
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:13,880
Warning.

164
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:17,440
Administrator Liu Yiyang's
mental breakdown is at 99%.

165
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:21,000
Extreme anger, sorrow,
and despair data detected.

166
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:25,120
The system is accelerating
the recovery of permissions.

167
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,760
So that's how it is.

168
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:31,200
But it's good if it means
you guys can go back.

169
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,090
Anyway, just like you said,

170
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,880
I'm just a self-righteous saint.

171
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:38,800
Xiao Han,

172
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:42,120
you must live on.

173
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:47,040
Then I wish you a safe journey.

174
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:49,680
Warning.

175
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:52,440
Unresolvable contradictory
emotional data detected.

176
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:54,440
Algorithm logic is caught
in an infinite loop.

177
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:55,600
Unable to calculate.

178
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,600
Unable to repair.

179
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:57,680
Unable to calculate.

180
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,680
Unable to repair.

181
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,600
System overload.

182
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,920
Liu Yiyang.

183
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,640
The core is collapsing.

184
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,400
Liu Yiyang,

185
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:09,530
Liu Yiyang, don't close your eyes.

186
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,800
We agreed to leave together.

187
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,200
We have to get out together.

188
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,000
I was lying to you just now.

189
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,680
I was lying.

190
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,160
Xiao Han,

191
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,600
why?

192
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,640
I'm sorry, Liu Yiyang. I'm sorry.

193
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,600
If I didn't do this,

194
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,680
none of us would be able to leave.

195
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,080
How could I leave you behind?

196
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:26,680
I will never leave you alone.

197
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:28,600
We have to get out of here alive together.

198
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,660
I'll take you home.

199
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:32,840
Damn you.

200
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:33,840
You acted so well.

201
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,200
When we get back,

202
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,080
this won't be over

203
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,340
without ten big meals.

204
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:41,600
Okay, whatever you want to eat
when we get back, it's on me.

205
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,400
Hang in there.

206
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,240
Han, Yang,

207
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,160
you're both okay.

208
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:49,000
Great, the plan worked.

209
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,240
We can go back.

210
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,200
Underlying logic rewrite detected.

211
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,960
Administrator permissions
have been revoked.

212
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,240
The world will return to reality.

213
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,080
Let's go.

214
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,800
Congratulations, players.

215
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:13,680
You have successfully cleared
the fifth station, Perfect Reality.

216
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,840
The return channel will soon open

217
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,820
for you to return to true reality.

218
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:39,600
Congratulations, players,
on passing the qualifiers.

219
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:42,260
Welcome, players,
to the official tournament.

220
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:46,000
Game rule: Only one car
can survive between cars.
